id: skill-in-fusion
name: Skill in Fusion
advancement: true
prerequisite: 4+ Skill Ranks in Performance
tpCost: 5
# "You may target any Character with the Metamoran Fusion Dance, regardless of their Size Category and Power Level" - neither asked
# of whom you target; nor that they be an Ally ("any Character").
danceAnyone: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  The Metamoran Fusion Dance at any Character, whatever their Size Category and Power Level.
text: >
  Skill in Fusion: You’re so skilled at the art of Fusion that you are able to fuse with almost anyone.
  –Prerequisites: 4+ Skill Ranks in Performance
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: You may target any Character with the Metamoran Fusion Dance, regardless of their Size Category and Power Level.
